{"ID":"20240513083111-fy9jsy8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083111-fy9jsy8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083111-fy9jsy8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513162613-mc5nfu5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513162613-mc5nfu5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513162613-mc5nfu5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:640,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:640\u0026#125;","title":"227","type":"doc","updated":"20240514155241"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513162613-mc5nfu5","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1038px;","id":"20240513162613-mc5nfu5","updated":"20240514155241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"183-1 G, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"80 / 體瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/8/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"支氣管肺癌"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1)  2006年6月被診斷肺癌，醫生說只能活一年。但現在仍然活著。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2) 因為雙足冰冷且色清，怕被開刀切除，所以來診。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3) 過去曾有肺結核"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠: 睡五小時，2:00 到7:00 AM。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 胃口 :好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 大便:下利，一天六次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 胸無痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 小便:黃，正常無頻尿。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 咳嗽多咳出黃痰時紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 口渴:尚好，溫飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 體力:很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 額溫手涼(未涼至骨)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、 雙足冰冷，靜脈曲張。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大、緩、中空脈"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→老年人之脈，有點扁掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左肺區白點為肺癌 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右肺區青色為pul.TB肺結核 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳孔反應無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下焦寒濕"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"芍藥甘草附子湯。葦莖湯。活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（一）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢  芍藥一兩  炙甘草一兩 牛膝三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 治療下焦寒濕，雙腳冰冷，炮附子加重五錢，使水容易加熱氣化，且熱藥令瘀化。因為沒有胸滿胸痛，故還用芍藥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（二）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葦莖三錢 丹皮三錢  桃仁三錢 冬瓜仁三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→葦莖湯，病人咳黃膿痰，肺中濕熱。唐容川先生在血證論稱久病必有瘀，此病人久咳有瘀，故師用葦莖湯。方中有桃仁、丹皮活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n（1）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般若病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌肺痛下利，用紫蔘。肺與大腸互為表裡。若肺有陰實，大腸之水，氣化上到肺之管道受阻，則水逆回到大腸排出，引起下利；對此病人而言是好事，因可排出多餘津液。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此病人肺癌，僅下利沒有肺痛，陽還在，故沒用紫蔘。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（3）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若病人咳出淡白痰，則用桔梗湯重用到一兩。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}